  "template": "Metric Generic Model.rft",
  "about": "CT modelled as a generic product inside the vendor envelope: plinth, side housings, gantry ring with bore liner and LED ring, display and control panels, patient table with floor plate, pedestal, carrier, cradle, pad, head holder, control panel and foot pedals. Service and shielding by MEP and A. Water and gases via the nested service point (FMC_P_MechEq_ServicePoint); Medical Equipment cannot hold pipe connectors. Reference: query: ct scanner medical equipment hospital; images: https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=ct+scanner+medical+equipment+hospital; basis: generic product; brand, model and supplier open for review",
